{"root":{"data":{"id":"975d7c24d563","created":1620019378,"text":"leetcode","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbb0fc6m3q80","created":1620796550455,"text":"数组","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbb0g4yvvoo0","created":1620796613114,"text":"54 spiral matrix\n59 spiral matrix2"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"ccoce7q0v6o0","created":1625806753576,"text":"56. Merge Intervals 合并 overlapping 数组\n57. Insert Interval"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cegxub7qlk00","created":1632367095539,"text":"252 & 253. Meeting Rooms II"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cckeexroeow0","created":1625406212665,"text":"48. Rotate Image（是逐行 90度旋转矩阵）\n先将数组中的值，按对角线坐标两两互换\n然后逐行进行数组反转，就可以得到想要的结果"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbyxgg3dzmg0","created":1623225612961,"text":"189. Rotate Array"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"ccddzf3141k0","created":1624694076834,"text":"315. Count of Smaller Numbers After Self（hard）\n1365. How Many Numbers Are Smaller Than the Current Number（easy）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"chmlwfegf680","created":1643911243122,"text":"加一题，难点在进位\n66. Plus One\n67. Add Binary\n369. Plus One Linked List"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cbb3kzpuehs0","created":1620805456834,"text":"栈\nStack","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"ccyr14vxtjk0","created":1626863644884,"text":"32. Longest Valid Parentheses\nstack+dp"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"ccatsm9zqgg0","created":1624434001831,"text":"71. Simplify Path"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbb3l1vqe140","created":1620805461543,"text":"150 reverse polish notation 要用栈的思想做"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cf7ttihlkuw0","created":1635097867399,"text":"224. Basic Calculator\n227. Basic Calculator II"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbb688unhcg0","created":1620812921311,"text":"394 同样是栈，我只能想出O(n^2)的写法，说明对栈的理解不到位\nps: 这一题还有个很酷的写法，用 regex 的 group"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"ccf45g41j7k0","created":1624869458071,"text":"1047 & 1209. Remove All Adjacent Duplicates in String II"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbdggzcj6i00","created":1621044936914,"text":"l768 hard 读题都很难，看不太懂\n这题不能算做了，要重新看一下"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbbrrfoz4ww0","created":1620873668433,"text":"946 这题挺不错的，有个constraint 就是栈中的元素不会重复！\n做题不要忽略边界条件\n这一题很适合我自己出一个教程，讲一下思考过程，一开始看半天别人的没看懂"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbb0ftbqwyo0","created":1620796587770,"text":"1381 差分法做题"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"ce4o73470h40","created":1631121166065,"text":"monostack\n单调栈","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"ce4o7a51k6g0","created":1631121181354,"text":"84. Largest Rectangle in Histogram"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"ce4o8dopd3s0","created":1631121267437,"text":"85. Maximal Rectangle（跟 84 非常相似，可以把矩形拆成 histogram）\n221. Maximal Square\n这两题描述很像，都是在 grid 中求正方形/长方形的最大面积，但是 84 和 85 是 monostack，221 是 dp"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"ceho2lvcmmg0","created":1632441094505,"text":"456. 132 Pattern 还没做"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"ce9sp2sa6xs0","created":1631641660123,"text":"739. Daily Temperatures\nmonostack  的模板，多练习"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"ce9que7is8g0","created":1631636434590,"text":"769 && 768. 最多能完成排序的块  I & II\nMax Chunks To Make Sorted"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cbb0ff1fkaw0","created":1620796556672,"text":"字符串","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbo1zl499880","created":1622121237733,"text":"459. Repeated Substring Pattern（686 的前序题\n686. Repeated String Match（挺有意思的"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cf7t2e9xajk0","created":1635095742395,"text":"125. Valid Palindrome\n680. Valid Palindrome II"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cehf2ien9lc0","created":1632415696976,"text":"simulation"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cehf2khcy400","created":1632415701493,"text":"657. Robot Return to Origin\n1041. Robot Bounded In Circle"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cbb0fksqk6g0","created":1620796569207,"text":"链表","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbm6btd89nk0","created":1621930360586,"text":"合并链表","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbjrxbfl57c0","created":1621686608996,"text":"2 add two numbers \n注意一下数学方法"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cczgcuaqwbk0","created":1626935089953,"text":"445. Add Two Numbers II"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbm6bq566jc0","created":1621930353568,"text":"21. Merge Two Sorted Lists\n合并两个有序链表\n23. Merge K Sorted Lists"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cboj0t8bdqw0","created":1622169292625,"text":"反转链表","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbituv48rjs0","created":1621590499017,"text":"25. Reverse Nodes in k-Group\nhard 题，有点难理解，多画图\n主要就是将问题简化到一次循环中再来操作节点"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbiqc7mjpkw0","created":1621580573996,"text":"92 reverseBetween\n206. Reverse Linked List\n反转链表"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"ccrvp0u2nxc0","created":1626165881547,"text":"143. Reorder List\n反转后半部分链表，merge"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cd8x9gic7w00","created":1627896823323,"text":"234. 回文链表"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cboj19lykns0","created":1622169328279,"text":"相交或环形链表","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbhqydccasw0","created":1621480750494,"text":"141&&142 Linked List Cycle  I&II"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbh2a1e853c0","created":1621411137109,"text":"160 getIntersectionNode 比较好懂，需要注意链表相等的条件不是 val相等"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cboj1ulfe6g0","created":1622169373959,"text":"设计题","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbij7npbptk0","created":1621560469402,"text":"146 LRUCache 双向链表 double linked list+hashtable\n双向链表需要操作三个节点(prev, cur, next)，四根指针(prev.next, cur.prev, cur.next, next.prev)\n为了便于操作，本题需要创建 dummy_head 和 dummy_tail\n\n460. LFU Cache (还没做)"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbgfcbdlnkg0","created":1621346430040,"text":"109. Convert Sorted List to Binary Search Tree 递归思想"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cczh28vh1bk0","created":1626937080785,"text":"707. Design Linked List"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cboj3h7uo800","created":1622169501568,"text":"拼接链表","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbfk53l79bc0","created":1621258410129,"text":"61 Rotate List \n快慢指针法：https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/rotate-list/solution/dong-hua-yan-shi-kuai-man-zhi-zhen-61-xu-7bp0/\n先计算链表的len ，再用 len % k 取余，简化 k 的值，减少链表循环的次数\n\n手动生成环来操作指针：https://leetcode.com/problems/rotate-list/discuss/348197/96-faster-Simple-python-solution-with-explanation\n这方法很巧妙很聪明，多画图理解"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cboj4h78i5s0","created":1622169579895,"text":"修改指针","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbhurq2gl400","created":1621491514086,"text":"24 Swap Nodes in Pairs\n1 递归解法可参考视频：https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/swap-nodes-in-pairs/solution/dong-hua-yan-shi-die-dai-yu-di-gui-liang-ha0u/\n2 直接遍历时，两两交换位置，相当于做一个小的逆序：https://leetcode.com/problems/swap-nodes-in-pairs/discuss/171788/Python-or-Dummynode\n这题两种解法都很生疏，多理解","expandState":"collapse","layout_right_offset":{"x":12,"y":4}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbfk519di7k0","created":1621258405060,"text":" ","image":"https://kityminder-img.gz.bcebos.com/cd2fa3de5956e2c9c27b9d39c46c68a5f4a40754","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":129,"height":200}},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cbm6iufncps0","created":1621930911458,"text":"82 && 83. Remove Duplicates from Sorted List I && II\n快慢指针 + dummy head"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cczh4335v940","created":1626937224918,"text":"链表排序"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cczh3rg3yso0","created":1626937199579,"text":"147. Insertion Sort List\n插入排序"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cczh5mq0ai80","created":1626937346022,"text":"148. Sort List\n归并排序"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cbjrkybjrpc0","created":1621685640084,"text":"树","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"ccr38ek68f40","created":1626085588155,"text":"same Tree","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbkkyg0cel40","created":1621768509510,"text":"100 same tree 两棵树的节点位置及其值是否完全相同\n101. Symmetric Tree 对称的树\n572 subtree-of-another-tree"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbjrl0v19bk0","created":1621685645616,"text":"104 max depth 求树的最大深度（递归）\n111. Minimum Depth of Binary Tree 求树的最小深度"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"ccr8s1qzl940","created":1626101233102,"text":"965. Univalued Binary Tree"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cd8x8n0kw4o0","created":1627896759122,"text":"226. invertTree"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cdnd8m9oeow0","created":1629363734647,"text":"1339. Maximum Product of Splitted Binary Tree\n递归计算子树的最大乘积"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"ccthklcz6cw0","created":1626329158780,"text":"path 路径题","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbl3hri6j5s0","created":1621820803430,"text":"129. Sum Root to Leaf Numbers\ndfs + recursion"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cc7gh3iapx40","created":1624091744670,"text":"112 && 113 && 437. path sum\nTree 的路径问题，path sum 1+2+3\n\n1和2 要求 root to leaf，3 要求是任何一段路径即可\n437 pathsum 3 还没做"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cctlf9l4paw0","created":1626340025770,"text":"257. Binary Tree Paths\nlc 113 的变种题"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"ccxxfc6wjwg0","created":1626780124586,"text":"124. Binary Tree Maximum Path Sum"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cd8xa4iy0nc0","created":1627896875602,"text":"543. diameterOfBinaryTree\n二叉树周长（实质上是求最长的路径距离）"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cctmnknked40","created":1626343497885,"text":"lowest common ancestor（LCA）\n相同的父节点","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cctmny9rhtc0","created":1626343527526,"text":"235. Lowest Common Ancestor of a Binary Search Tree"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cctmns48ars0","created":1626343514130,"text":"236. Lowest Common Ancestor of a Binary Tree"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cbldmstpfhc0","created":1621849409224,"text":"遍历 traversal","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cblz23rsvug0","created":1621909851824,"text":"94. Binary Tree Inorder Traversal\n144. Binary Tree Preorder Traversal\n145. Binary Tree Postorder Traversal\nmethod1: dfs+recursion\nmethod2: iteration","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbm5nuoz5340","created":1621928482733,"text":"98. Validate Binary Search Tree\n中序遍历变种题，二叉搜索树"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cc7iyv4edig0","created":1624098779190,"text":"114. Flatten Binary Tree to Linked List\n前序遍历，二叉树转链表，需要注意一下转链表时的操作节点方法"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"ccp8gii4u8o0","created":1625897209289,"text":"N 叉树的前序遍历和后序遍历\n589. N-ary Tree Preorder Traversal\n590. N-ary Tree Postorder Traversal"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"ccs2cq9tra00","created":1626184665954,"text":"872. Leaf-Similar Trees\n利用后序遍历特性"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cblz25eh3a00","created":1621909855372,"text":"102. Binary Tree Level Order Traversal 层序遍历\n107. Binary Tree Level Order Traversal II（102 的逆序输出打印"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cdemprnsi0w0","created":1628476428955,"text":"116&117. Populating Next Right Pointers in Each Node\n层序遍历变种题"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cdcd1tmdyf40","created":1628246042581,"text":"103. Binary Tree Zigzag Level Order Traversal\nZ 型遍历，层序遍历的变种题"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cd3ubv5ut0g0","created":1627380748835,"text":"199. Binary Tree Right Side View"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"ccrxpt5a5mg0","created":1626171585395,"text":"429. N-ary Tree Level Order Traversal\nN 叉树层序遍历"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cblzoy10zxc0","created":1621911641697,"text":"513. Find Bottom Left Tree Value\n层序遍历变种题"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"ccr2mjm7kjc0","created":1626083875151,"text":"1302. Deepest Leaves Sum\n最深一层的叶子结点和，根据 102 改写"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"ccp8argxry80","created":1625896758622,"text":"429. N-ary Tree Level Order Traversal\nN 叉树层序遍历，根据 102 改写"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cekvyi6ywps0","created":1632768021793,"text":"垂序遍历","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cekvynizuqg0","created":1632768033404,"text":"314. Binary Tree Vertical Order Traversal"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbnttolvonk0","created":1622098206265,"text":"垂序遍历，要复习\n987. Vertical Order Traversal of a Binary Tree","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbntw1a8y740","created":1622098390588,"text":"对位于 (row, col) 的每个结点而言，其左右子结点分别位于 (row + 1, col - 1) 和 (row + 1, col + 1) 。树的根结点位于 (0, 0) 。\n\n二叉树的 垂序遍历 从最左边的列开始直到最右边的列结束，按列索引每一列上的所有结点，形成一个按出现位置从上到下排序的有序列表。\n如果同行同列上有多个结点，则按结点的值从小到大进行排序。"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"cbnvoeyn9dc0","created":1622103435668,"text":"构造 construct"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbnvrd6f0m00","created":1622103666877,"text":"105. Construct Binary Tree from Preorder and Inorder Traversal \n通过二叉树的前序和中序遍历结果，输出一棵树"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbnwhq8qdbc0","created":1622105732783,"text":"106. Construct Binary Tree from Inorder and Postorder Traversal\n通过二叉树的中序和后序遍历结果，构造一个树"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cbnwyjhxiy80","created":1622107050292,"text":"889. Construct Binary Tree from Preorder and Postorder Traversal\n889. 根据前序和后序遍历构造二叉树"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cd8xakobvvc0","created":1627896910756,"text":"617. mergeTrees 合并二叉树"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cdu5wruc8m00","created":1630053978338,"text":"331. isValidSerialization 前序遍历 + 栈"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"ccswxs4u3eo0","created":1626270948951,"text":"修剪 prune & trim"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"ccsx5cfb5sw0","created":1626271541669,"text":"669. Trim a Binary Search Tree"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cctezjcoops0","created":1626321866541,"text":"814. Binary Tree Pruning\nrecursion"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cctgo9pun2w0","created":1626326625783,"text":"1325. Delete Leaves With a Given Value"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cbn8njpdf0w0","created":1622038482099,"text":"完全二叉树\nComplete Binary Tree","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbn6eev5ogo0","created":1622032124067,"text":"297. Serialize and Deserialize Binary Tree\n挺难的，没太看懂，记得回头复习\n\n完全二叉树的的构造"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"cbn8np368sw0","created":1622038493817,"text":"平衡二叉树\nBalance Binary Tree\n又称 AVL 树\nAdelson-Velsky and Landis Tree","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cbnpkdxqaj40","created":1622086193319,"text":"110. Balanced Binary Tree 判断二叉树是否是平衡二叉树"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"